# Copy this file to `.streamlit/secrets.toml` for local use.
# On Streamlit Community Cloud, paste these same keys/values into
# your app's "Secrets" settings instead of committing a real secrets.toml.
#
# .streamlit/secrets.toml is gitignored — never commit real secrets.
#
# No secrets are required for the public dashboard today. Data refresh runs
# via GitHub Actions (see AUTOMATION.md), not an in-app admin control.
#
# Example placeholder if you add secrets later:
# SOME_API_KEY = "change-me"

# No credentials needed for the social-mentions signal — it uses StockTwits'
# free, public, unauthenticated API (src/collectors/social_mentions.py).
